<!-- MANAGED BY YOU, NOT my-bt -- this is a generic starting-point homepage,
     not generated. Copy to site/index.html (untracked -- see README.md
     "Static-site pages"), replace every REPLACE-ME marker, and update the
     course list below to match your own settings.toml [[course]] entries
     (shortname must match exactly -- that's what /book/<shortname>
     resolves to).

     2026-07-06: the small "Login" link/button below is deliberately
     STATIC -- no JS, no "logged in as..." state, nothing that reads
     cookies or calls the app. Two reasons: (1) this page is also embedded
     via <iframe> elsewhere (a separate "center homepage") -- anything
     session-aware here would mean detecting login state across that
     iframe boundary, which third-party-cookie restrictions in modern
     browsers make unreliable at best; (2) target="_top" on the link means
     clicking it always breaks OUT of any iframe and navigates the WHOLE
     browser tab to /my, whether this page is being viewed standalone or
     embedded -- so it keeps working inside the iframe embed without any
     extra code, degrading to a perfectly normal same-tab link when this
     page is viewed on its own. If you remove or restyle this, keep both
     the target="_top" and the plain <a> (no onclick/JS) -- see
     README.md's "Course overview page" section for the dynamic
     (session-aware) banner equivalent on /courses and /book. -->
<html>
<head>
<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
<title>REPLACE-ME-YOUR-SITE-NAME</title>
<style>
 body { max-width: 760px; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; font-family: sans-serif; }
 footer { margin-top: 3em; font-size: 0.85em; color: #666; }
 .top-bar { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
 .login-btn { font-size: 0.85em; padding: 0.3em 0.9em; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px;
              text-decoration: none; color: #222; }
 .login-btn:hover { background: #f4f7f4; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="top-bar"><a class="login-btn" href="/my" target="_top">Login</a></div>

<h1>REPLACE-ME-YOUR-SITE-NAME</h1>

<p>REPLACE-ME: a short description of what you offer and who it's for.</p>

<h2>Upcoming sessions</h2>
<ul>
  <li><a href="/book/example-monday-class">Example Class -- Monday 18:00: book your place here.</a></li>
  <li><a href="/book/example-thursday-class">Example Class (Advanced) -- Thursday 19:00: book your place here.</a></li>
</ul>

<footer>
<a href="/terms.html">Terms</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
<a href="/privacy.html">Privacy policy</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
<a href="/impressum.html">Impressum / Legal notice</a>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
